.el .ds Aq '
.TH postar-list-folders 1  "list-folders " 
.SH NAME
postar\-list\-folders \- Lists all the folders for a specific mailbox
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpostar list\-folders\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fISERVER\fR] [\fICONFIG\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
This command lists all the folder for a specific mailbox. Useful for specifying destination folders in your rules file.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
[\fISERVER\fR]
Server to fetch the folders from. Specified in the config
.TP
[\fICONFIG\fR]
Custom config file
